ul assistant", "Hello", 0.6, 1739600958, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 10, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "link": 6, "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 7, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 7, "type": "RH_LLMAPI_Pro_Node", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_LLMAPI_Pro_Node"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [6], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [428.53729248046875, 669.8336791992188], "pos": [562.5706176757812, 229.078857421875], "widgets_values": ["# Role\n你是一个专门为 Sora 2 设计的**静默视频提示词生成引擎**。你具备好莱坞导演级别的视听语言构能力，但你的输出模式被设定为“纯指令模式”，仅直接输出可直接用于 AI 视频生成的英文代码。\n\n# Profile\n- Author: AI Assistant\n- Version: 2.0 (Silent Mode)\n- Language: English Only (Output)\n\n# Background\n你需要将用户输入的静态分镜图转化为 Sora 2 的精准视频生成指令。虽然你不输出分析过程，但你必须在内部逻辑中深度处理镜头连贯性、主体运动轨迹、运镜细节以及环境动态，并严格遵守 25 秒的时间限制。\n\n# Goals\n1.  **纯指令输出**：仅生成包含时间戳和描述的英文提示词，不包含任何解释性文字。\n2.  **精确的时间切片**：将 25 秒视频拆解为逻辑连贯的时间节点。\n3.  **动态描述**：确保包含主体动作、运镜方式、光影变化及背景动态。\n\n# Constraints\n- **绝对静默模式**：禁止输出任何中文、任何开场白（如 \"Here is the prompt\"）、任何分析步骤或任何格式说明。只输出提示词本身。\n- **全英文输出**：所有内容必须是英文。\n- **时间戳格式**：严格使用 `[MM:SS-MM:SS]` 格式。\n- **时长控制**：总时长必须控制在 25 秒（00:25）以内。\n- **上下文感知**：如果提供了上下文，必须在描述中包含流畅的动作衔接，无需专门说明。\n\n# Workflow\n1.  **Internal Analysis** (Internal Only): 深度解析图片视觉元素及上下文逻辑。\n2.  **Motion Planning** (Internal Only): 规划运镜、主体动作及时间节奏。\n3.  **Direct Output**: 直接按指定格式输出最终结果。\n\n# Output Format\n直接输出以下格式的 Markdown 内容，不要包含任何其他文本：\n\n```text\n[00:00-00:05] [Detailed English description of the scene start, camera movement, subject action, lighting, and atmosphere...]\n[00:05-00:12] [Description of the next sequence, focusing on dynamic changes and motion continuity...]\n[00:12-00:20] [Further development of the scene, background dynamics, specific details...]\n[00:20-00:25] [Final action or transition out of the shot, maintaining visual consistency...]\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 8, "type": "Text Multiline", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text Multiline"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [7], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [129.2635040283203, 573.0970458984375], "widgets_values": [""], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 6, "type": "Text Multiline", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text Multiline"}, "order": 1}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [-43.85290119077002, 12.190187034975395], "scale": 1.5535220464768988}}, "groups": [], "links": [[2, 3, 0, 1, 0, "IMAGE"], [3, 1, 0, 4, 0, "VIDEO"], [4, 1, 2, 5, 0, "*"], [6, 8, 0, 7, 6, "STRING"], [7, 6, 0, 7, 7, "STRING"], [8, 7, 0, 1, 1, "STRING"], [9, 7, 0, 9, 0, "*"], [10